#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:1
msgid "Creating and managing gradients in Krita."
msgstr "介绍如何在 Krita 中创建和管理渐变。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:12
#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:17
msgid "Gradients"
msgstr "渐变"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:12
msgid "Resources"
msgstr "资源"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:20
msgid "Accessing a Gradient"
msgstr "渐变面板"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:22
msgid ""
"The Gradients configuration panel is accessed by clicking the Gradients icon "
"(usually the icon next to the disk)."
msgstr "渐变面板可以通过工具栏靠左的渐变图标访问，默认在保存按钮旁边。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:25
msgid ".. image:: images/gradients/Gradient_Toolbar_Panel.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/gradients/Gradient_Toolbar_Panel.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:26
msgid ""
"Gradients are configurations of blending between colors.  Krita provides "
"over a dozen preset dynamic gradients for you to choose from.  In addition, "
"you can design and save your own."
msgstr ""
"渐变是不同颜色之间的过渡。Krita 自带了许多渐变预设，你也可以制作自定义渐变。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:28
msgid "Some typical uses of gradients are:"
msgstr "渐变的常见用途有："

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:30
msgid "Fill for vector shapes."
msgstr "填充矢量形状"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:31
msgid "Gradient tool"
msgstr "渐变工具"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:32
msgid "As a source of color for the pixel brush."
msgstr "作为像素笔刷引擎的颜色来源"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:34
msgid ""
"There is no gradients docker. They can only be accessed through the gradient "
"\"quick-menu\" in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Krita 没有准备单独的渐变面板，如上文所述，你可以在工具栏的按钮访问渐变弹出面"
"板。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:37
msgid "Editing a Gradient"
msgstr "编辑渐变"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:39
msgid "Krita has two gradient types:"
msgstr "Krita 有两种渐变类型："

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:41
msgid ""
"Segmented Gradients, which are compatible with GIMP, have many different "
"features but are also a bit complicated to make."
msgstr "片段渐变，与 GIMP 的渐变兼容。这种渐变的功能丰富但制作起来比较复杂。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:42
msgid ""
"Stop Gradients, which are saved as SVG files and similar to how most "
"applications do their gradients, but has less features than the segmented "
"gradient."
msgstr ""
"色标渐变，可被直接保存为 SVG 文件。这种渐变和其他大多数程序处理渐变的方式类"
"似，但功能相对较少。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:44
msgid ""
"Initially we could only make segmented gradients in Krita, but in 3.0.2 we "
"can also make stop gradients."
msgstr "Krita 原本只能制作片段渐变，自 3.0.2 起开始可以制作色标渐变。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:49
msgid ""
"You can make a new gradient by going into the drop-down and selecting the "
"gradient type you wish to have. By default Krita will make a stop-gradient."
msgstr ""
"在渐变弹出菜单的“新建”按钮右侧，点击下箭头按钮即可选择新建的渐变类型。如果直"
"接点击新建按钮，默认将新建色标渐变。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:52
msgid "Stop Gradients"
msgstr "色标渐变"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:57
msgid "Stop gradients are very straight forward:"
msgstr "色标渐变的制作方式如下："

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:59
msgid "|mouseleft| on the gradient to add a stop."
msgstr "在渐变条上左键点击 |mouseleft| 即可添加一个色标。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:60
msgid "|mouseleft| on the stops to select them, and drag to move them."
msgstr "左键点击 |mouseleft| 色标可以选中它，也可以拖动它的位置。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:61
msgid ""
"Drag stops outside of the bar (further than the way to the left or right) to "
"remove them."
msgstr "将色标拖到渐变条左右两侧之外，即可删除该色标。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:66
msgid ""
"A selected stop can have its color and transparency changed using the color "
"button and the opacity slider below."
msgstr ""
"选中色标后，可以在下面的色标颜色按钮和不透明度滑动条处更改它的颜色和不透明"
"度。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:71
msgid ""
"As per SVG spec, you can make a sudden change between stops by moving them "
"close together. The stops will overlap, but you can still drag them around."
msgstr ""
"按照 SVG 规范，两个色标可以距离很近，制作出跳跃的颜色变化。你还可以将一个色标"
"从另一个色标的一侧拉到另外一侧。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:73
msgid ""
"Gradients can have stops that use the currently selected Foreground or "
"Background colors"
msgstr "在渐变中可以使用反映了当前前景色和背景色的色标。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:77
msgid ".. image:: images/gradients/Krita_Stop_Gradient_Editor_Popup.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/gradients/Krita_Stop_Gradient_Editor_Popup.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:79
msgid "Segmented Gradients"
msgstr "片段渐变"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:82
msgid ".. image:: images/gradients/Krita_Editing_Custom_Gradient.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/gradients/Krita_Editing_Custom_Gradient.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:83
msgid ""
"Segmented gradients are a bit more tricky. Instead of going from color to "
"color, it allows you to define segments, which each can have a begin and end "
"color."
msgstr ""
"片段渐变比色标渐变要复杂一些。它不按颜色到颜色来定义渐变，而是通过片段的方式"
"定义渐变。每个片段具有起始色和结束色。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:85
msgid "|mouseright| the gradient to call up this menu:"
msgstr ""
"右键点击 |mouseright| 渐变条将弹出下图菜单，可以进行分割、复制、翻转、删除操"
"作。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:90
msgid "Split Segment"
msgstr "分割片段"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:91
msgid ""
"This splits the current segment in two, using the white arrow, the segment "
"middle as the place to split. It will also use the color at the white arrow "
"to define the new colors in place in the new segments."
msgstr ""
"此操作将把当前片段一分为二，分割点是当前片段的颜色中间点 (白色三角标)。位于原"
"片段中间点的颜色也将被用作分割后两个新片段在同一位置的颜色。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:92
msgid "Duplicate segment"
msgstr "复制片段"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:93
msgid ""
"Similar to split, but instead the two new segments are copies of the old one."
msgstr "此操作虽然也是将片段一分为二，但分割后的两个新片段都是原有片段的复制。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:94
msgid "Mirror segment"
msgstr "翻转片段"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:95
msgid "Mirrors the segment colors."
msgstr "将选中片段的颜色翻转。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:97
msgid "Remove segment"
msgstr "删除片段"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:97
msgid "Removes the segment."
msgstr "删除选中的渐变片段。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:99
msgid ""
"|mouseleft| + dragging the black arrows will resize the segments attaching "
"to those arrows. |mouseleft| + dragging the white arrows will change the mid "
"point of that segment, changing the way how the mixture is made."
msgstr ""
"左键点击 |mouseleft| + 拖动黑色三角标可以拉伸与它连接的片段。左键点击 |"
"mouseleft| + 拖动白色三角标可以移动该片段颜色中间点的位置，改变颜色混合的效"
"果。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:101
msgid ""
"At the bottom, you can set the color and transparency of either part of the "
"segment."
msgstr ""
"点击对话框底部的颜色块可以弹出拾色器，它的右边还有不透明度数值框，用于更改当"
"前片段的左端颜色和右端颜色。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:103
msgid "You can also set the blending. The first is the interpolation mode:"
msgstr "对话框右下角还有两个下拉选单。第一个选单用于选择插值模式："

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:108
msgid "Linear - Does a linear blending between both segments."
msgstr "线性渐变 - 在片段左右之间进行线性颜色混合。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:109
msgid "Curved - This causes the mix to ease-in and out faster."
msgstr "曲线渐变 - 靠近左右两侧的颜色变化较为急促。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:110
msgid ""
"Sine - Uses a sine function. This causes the mix to ease in and out slower."
msgstr "正弦渐变 - 按照正弦函数进行渐变，靠近左右两侧的颜色变化较为平缓。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:111
msgid ""
"Sphere, increasing - This puts emphasis on the later color during the mix."
msgstr "球面增大渐变 - 强调右侧颜色。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:112
msgid ""
"Sphere, decreasing - This puts emphasis on the first color during the mix."
msgstr "球面减小渐变 - 强调左侧颜色。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:114
msgid "Finally, there's the model:"
msgstr "第二个下拉选单用于选择混合颜色时所用的色彩模型："

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:119
msgid "RGB"
msgstr "RGB"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:120
msgid "Does the blending in RGB model."
msgstr "使用 RGB 色彩模型进行颜色混合。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:121
msgid "HSV clockwise"
msgstr "HSV 顺时针色相"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:122
msgid ""
"Blends the two colors using the HSV model, and follows the hue clockwise "
"(red-yellow-green-cyan-blue-purple). The above screenshot is an example of "
"this."
msgstr ""
"使用 HSV 色彩模型混合片段左右两种颜色，按照顺时针方向改变色相 (红-黄-绿-青-"
"蓝-紫)，如上图所示。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:124
msgid "HSV counter-clock wise."
msgstr "HSV 逆时针色相"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:124
msgid "Blends the color as the previous options, but then counter-clockwise."
msgstr "使用 HSV 色彩模型混合片段左右两种颜色，按照逆时针方向改变色相。"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/resource_gradients.rst:126
msgid ""
"Gradients can have segment endpoints that use the currently selected "
"Foreground or Background colors, and those endpoints can be transparent.  "
"These features allow full compatibility with GIMP gradients."
msgstr ""
"在渐变中可以使用前景色和背景色作为片段端点，且片段端点可以是透明的。上述特性"
"与 GIMP 渐变完全兼容。"
